Package: plz-run
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: run programs across a sandbox boundary
 plz-run asks the systemd system manager to start a program in a new execution
 environment. With suitable D-Bus and systemd permissions, this lets a
 confined application run a payload outside its own sandbox.
 .
 Standard input, output, and error are connected to the calling process, and
 the payload's exit status is relayed to the caller.
